OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome showers
OL,6,Fspreading southward through the
OL,7,Fevening period, these may be rather
OL,8,Fheavy at times. Most likely over
OL,9,FCumbria although still possible
OL,10,Ffurther south. Turning drier through
OL,11,Fthe night with clear spells. Rather
OL,12,Fchilly in some spots.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FDry on Monday with plenty of
OL,15,Fsunshine and light winds. Sunshine
OL,16,Fwill turn a little hazy later in the
OL,17,Fafternoon. Feeling warm in the
OL,18,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
