OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FLargely dry with sunny spells over the
OL,7,Fnext few days, and perhaps the odd
OL,8,Fshower. Turning increasingly hot and
OL,9,Fmore humid later in the week.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
